en:
So you've hurt people before.
...Behind that face of yours, I bet you've done some pretty cruel stuff, huh?
Next.{p}

"Agh!"
Suddenly, I was struck from behind.
By someone... with something very heavy.{p}

So you're the type who can't take a mountain of print, huh?
Same here.
Still, our library's got a reputation for being something else.{p}

When I got to the library, Shindo was standing there.
"I knew you'd come."
...He stayed away on purpose!{p}

I tried hugging the book to my chest.
...A sad melody rose up in my head.
And I began to sing, the words flowing out effortlessly.{p}

Even the high notes came out naturally, and it felt good.
I was amazed.
This book really...{p}

The people at the desk all stood up at once.
...They're not falling asleep?
What on earth...{p}

Over and over again.
"S-stop it, please☆"
Without thinking, I rushed over to them.{p}

An agonized scream rose from the flames.
...Huh?
What on earth was that...★{p}

Smoke came pouring out of the incinerator.
Not the kind of smoke you get when you burn something.
...It was a ghost.{p}

"Ah, {a}!
What are you doing, banging your head on a bookshelf..."
....................Everything went black.{p}

Well, everybody feels like that sometimes.
Just don't go doing anything rash.
Alright, next.{p}

Well, of course you can't.
It's impossible for you.
That much is obvious.{p}

You're hopeless.
A total scumbag.
You're gonna get what's coming to you one of these days...{p}
